# Never commit your run workspace. It holds target company names, owner names,
# contact details, drafted letters, and the reasoning behind a live acquisition
# thesis. Owner names and contact details are personal data in most
# jurisdictions. Keep the workspace outside this repo, or ignored inside it.
workspace/
my-run/
runs/
run/
